  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine lamb, red onion, red bell pepper, tomato, parsley, garlic, ginger, olive oil, lemon juice, salt, black pepper, cumin, coriander, and cayenne pepper. Mix well to combine.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
